    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "body": "\n### Discussed in https://github.com/encode/django-rest-framework/discussions/9925\n\n<div type='discussions-op-text'>\n\n<sup>Originally posted by **kazei92** March 19, 2026</sup>\nThe problem is with this line: \r\n`datetime.datetime.fromisoformat(field_value) if format_ == ISO_8601`\r\n\r\n[Line Link](https://github.com/encode/django-rest-framework/blob/6f03b79c057c470524b12e9ac46bc2bb384570e0/rest_framework/renderers.py#L357)\r\n\r\nin rest_framework\\renderers.py.\r\n\r\nIf the field_value is an empty string '', a ValueError is raised.\r\nBefore 3.17.0 the empty date strings were supported.\r\n\r\nI don't know if this is an issue or the null values are not handled properly.</div>",
